          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. You are given some number cards; 4000, 13000, 300, 70000, 150000, 20, 5. Using the cards get as close as you can to the numbers below using any operation you want. Each card can be used only once for making a particular number."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.206,
            0.166,
            0.793,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) 1,10,000: Closest I could make is 4000 × (20 + 5) + 13000 = 1,13,000"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.209,
            0.348,
            0.23
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) 2,00,000:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.207,
            0.233,
            0.349,
            0.254
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) 5,80,000:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.257,
            0.358,
            0.278
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) 12,45,000:"
